{"hw":"μάχη","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">μάχη</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μάχ-η</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">μάχομαι</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">battle, combat</b>, freq. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, usu. of armies, <span class=\"gk\">μ. καὶ φύλοπις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.789</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ ἶσα μ. τέτατο πτόλεμός τε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.436</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. ἐνοπή τε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.35</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μάχαι τ' ἀνδροκτασίαι τε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.237</span> </span>; sts. of <b class=\"lex-tr\">single combat</b>, ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">158</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">232</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">263</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. καὶ δηϊοτής</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">290</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ναῶν ἐν μάχαις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.34</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μάχαις καὶ ναυμαχίαις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">30.26</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μάχη δορός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">439</span> </span> (lyr.), etc.: with Verbs, <span class=\"gk\">μάχην μάχεσθαι</spa